[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  木牛流马（改良运粮器械）即为解决这一问题而创制[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#0066FF][url={"research": "蒋琬", "cat": "people"}]蒋琬[/url][/color]曾提议转用水运（顺沔水东出），即绕开蜀道困境[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


